  1	/**
  2	 * Tests for validate command exit codes
  3	 *
  4	 * AC: @cli-exit-codes
  5	 *
  6	 * Exit code behavior:
  7	 * - 0 (SUCCESS): No errors, no warnings
  8	 * - 4 (VALIDATION_FAILED): Errors present (schema, refs, trait cycles, etc.)
  9	 * - 6 (VALIDATION_WARNINGS): Warnings only (orphans, completeness, alignment, staleness)
 10	 *
 11	 * Note: --strict flag only escalates orphan and staleness warnings to errors,
 12	 * not completeness warnings.
 13	 */
